msgid ""
"Per-process UBS IO memory pool size in GB. The recommended value is `10`. "
"The supported range is an integer from `0` to `1024`; SSD caching requires "
"at least `5` GB per process. The total allocation must not exceed the node "
"memory available after reserving memory for the operating system, vLLM, and "
"the Memcache DRAM pool."
msgstr ""
"每个进程的 UBS IO 内存池大小（以 GB 为单位）。推荐值为 `10`。支持范围为 `0` 到 `1024` 的整数；SSD 缓存要求每个进程至少"
" `5` GB。总分配量不得超过为操作系统、vLLM 和 Memcache DRAM 池预留内存后剩余的节点内存。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`ubsio.standalone.device_count`"
msgstr "`ubsio.standalone.device_count`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Number of local services whose `ock.mmc.local_service.dram.size` is not `0`."
msgstr "`ock.mmc.local_service.dram.size` 不为 `0` 的本地服务数量。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:773
msgid ""
"When adjusting the recommended value, calculate the maximum permitted per-"
"process value by dividing the node memory available to UBS IO by the number "
"of DRAM-enabled local services, rounding down, and capping the result at "
"`1024`:"
msgstr ""
"调整推荐值时，将 UBS IO 可用的节点内存除以启用 DRAM 的本地服务数量，向下取整，并将结果上限设为 "
"`1024`，以此计算每个进程允许的最大值："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:779
msgid ""
"For example, if `200` GB is available to UBS IO and four local services have"
" DRAM enabled, the upper limit is `50` GB per process, so the recommended "
"value `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb = 10` is valid. If the calculated upper limit is"
" less than `5`, free more node memory or reduce the number of DRAM-enabled "
"local services."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果 UBS IO 可用 `200` GB，且有四个本地服务启用了 DRAM，则每个进程的上限为 `50` GB，因此推荐值 "
"`ubsio.mem.size_in_gb = 10` 是有效的。如果计算出的上限小于 `5`，请释放更多节点内存或减少启用 DRAM 的本地服务数量。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:781
#, python-format
msgid ""
"For SSD caching, `10` GB per process is generally sufficient and does not "
"need to be configured much larger. If you want to use the L2.5 memory "
"caching capability, increase `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` within the limits above "
"and adjust "
"[`ubsio.wcache.evict_water_level`](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#ubsiowcacheevict_water_level)"
" accordingly."
msgstr ""
"对于 SSD 缓存，每个进程 `10` GB 通常足够，无需配置得更大。如果要使用 L2.5 内存缓存能力，请在上述限制内增加 "
"`ubsio.mem.size_in_gb`，并相应调整 "
"[`ubsio.wcache.evict_water_level`](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#ubsiowcacheevict_water_level)。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:783
#, python-format
msgid ""
"For disk partitioning, capacity, eviction watermarks, and other UBS IO "
"parameters, see the [DRAM + SSD Multi-level Pooling Configuration "
"Guide](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关磁盘分区、容量、逐出水印及其他 UBS IO 参数，请参阅 [DRAM + SSD "
"多级池化配置指南](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md)。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:785
msgid "Separated Deployment of MemCache and vLLM"
msgstr "MemCache 与 vLLM 分离部署"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:787
msgid ""
"This deployment mode runs MemCache and vLLM in different processes. It is "
"different from vLLM PD disaggregation. In the default co-located mode, vLLM "
"loads the model weights before the KV connector initializes MemCache. As a "
"result, MemCache may not be able to reserve sufficient memory from the "
"remaining available space. Starting a standalone MemCache process before "
"vLLM allows MemCache to reserve a larger memory pool."
msgstr ""
"此部署模式将 MemCache 和 vLLM 运行在不同的进程中。这与 vLLM PD 分离不同。在默认的共置模式下，vLLM 在 KV 连接器初始化 "
"MemCache 之前加载模型权重。因此，MemCache 可能无法从剩余可用空间中预留足够的内存。在 vLLM 之前启动独立的 MemCache "
"进程，可以让 MemCache 预留更大的内存池。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:789
msgid ""
"Prepare two LocalService configuration files with the same connection and "
"protocol settings. The configuration used by the vLLM process does not "
"contribute DRAM:"
msgstr "准备两个连接和协议设置相同的 LocalService 配置文件。vLLM 进程使用的配置不贡献 DRAM："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:797
msgid ""
"The configuration used by the standalone MemCache process specifies the "
"amount of DRAM to contribute:"
msgstr "独立 MemCache 进程使用的配置指定了要贡献的 DRAM 量："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:805
msgid ""
"The preceding sizes are examples. Adjust them according to the available "
"memory, and set `ock.mmc.local_service.max.dram.size` to accommodate the "
"maximum `dram.size` used by the LocalService processes."
msgstr ""
"上述大小仅为示例。请根据可用内存进行调整，并将 `ock.mmc.local_service.max.dram.size` 设置为能够容纳 "
"LocalService 进程使用的最大 `dram.size`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:807
msgid "Deploy the services in the following order:"
msgstr "按以下顺序部署服务："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:809
msgid "Start MetaService as described above."
msgstr "按上述说明启动 MetaService。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:810
msgid ""
"Before starting vLLM, start a standalone MemCache process with `mmc-local-"
"standalone.conf` on every node. These processes contribute the configured "
"DRAM to the memory pool."
msgstr ""
"在启动 vLLM 之前，在每个节点上使用 `mmc-local-standalone.conf` 启动一个独立的 MemCache "
"进程。这些进程将配置的 DRAM 贡献给内存池。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:811
msgid ""
"Wait until the standalone MemCache process reports successful initialization"
" on every node."
msgstr "等待每个节点上的独立 MemCache 进程报告初始化成功。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:812
msgid ""
"Set `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` to `mmc-local.conf`, and then start the vLLM "
"inference processes as described above. MemCache in the vLLM processes "
"connects to the existing memory pool without contributing additional DRAM."
msgstr ""
"将 `MMC_LOCAL_CONFIG_PATH` 设置为 `mmc-local.conf`，然后按上述说明启动 vLLM 推理进程。vLLM 进程中的"
" MemCache 连接到现有内存池，不贡献额外的 DRAM。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:814
#, python-format
msgid ""
"For the standalone MemCache startup script and the complete A3 deployment "
"procedure, see "
"<https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/MemCache+vLLM+A3%E5%88%86%E7%A6%BB%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B.md>."
msgstr ""
"有关独立 MemCache 启动脚本和完整的 A3 部署流程，请参阅 "
"<https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/MemCache+vLLM+A3%E5%88%86%E7%A6%BB%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B.md>。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:816
msgid "Example of using Yuanrong as a KV Pool backend"
msgstr "使用 Yuanrong 作为 KV 池后端的示例"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:819
msgid ""
"Install `openyuanrong-datasystem` on all nodes (`yr.datasystem` must be "
"importable)."
msgstr "在所有节点上安装 `openyuanrong-datasystem`（必须可导入 `yr.datasystem`）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:821
msgid "Install Yuanrong Datasystem"
msgstr "安装 Yuanrong Datasystem"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:827
msgid ""
"If the prebuilt package does not match the CANN or Ascend driver version in "
"your environment, build Yuanrong Datasystem from source in the vLLM Ascend "
"image. Follow the official Yuanrong Datasystem build instructions: "
"<https://atomgit.com/openeuler/yuanrong-datasystem>"
msgstr ""
"如果预构建包与您环境中的 CANN 或 Ascend 驱动版本不匹配，请在 vLLM Ascend 镜像中从源码构建 Yuanrong "
"Datasystem。请遵循官方 Yuanrong Datasystem "
"构建说明：<https://atomgit.com/openeuler/yuanrong-datasystem>"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:832
msgid "Start etcd"
msgstr "启动 etcd"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:834
msgid ""
"Yuanrong Datasystem uses etcd for service discovery. The following example "
"starts a single-node etcd cluster:"
msgstr "Yuanrong Datasystem 使用 etcd 进行服务发现。以下示例启动一个单节点 etcd 集群："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:863
msgid ""
"For production environments, refer to the official etcd clustering "
"documentation: <https://etcd.io/docs/v3.7/op-guide/clustering/>"
msgstr ""
"对于生产环境，请参考官方 etcd 集群文档：<https://etcd.io/docs/v3.7/op-guide/clustering/>"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:866
msgid "Start Datasystem Worker"
msgstr "启动 Datasystem Worker"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:868
msgid ""
"Start a Datasystem worker on each node by using `dscli`. The following "
"configuration is a recommended starting point for high-throughput KV Pool "
"workloads:"
msgstr "使用 `dscli` 在每个节点上启动一个 Datasystem worker。以下配置是针对高吞吐量 KV 池工作负载的推荐起点："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:892
msgid ""
"The `--worker_address` value is consumed later by `DS_WORKER_ADDR`, so keep "
"the host and port identical on the same node."
msgstr "`--worker_address` 的值稍后由 `DS_WORKER_ADDR` 使用，因此请确保同一节点上的主机和端口保持一致。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:895
msgid "The tuning parameters above have the following effects:"
msgstr "上述调优参数具有以下效果："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`log_dir`"
msgstr "`log_dir`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Sets the Datasystem worker log directory. Create the directory and grant the"
" worker process write permission before startup."
msgstr "设置 Datasystem worker 日志目录。启动前请创建该目录并授予 worker 进程写入权限。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`arena_per_tenant=1`"
msgstr "`arena_per_tenant=1`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Uses one shared-memory arena per tenant as a conservative starting point for"
" memory and file-descriptor usage."
msgstr "每个租户使用一个共享内存 arena，作为内存和文件描述符使用的保守起点。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`enable_huge_tlb=true`"
msgstr "`enable_huge_tlb=true`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Backs worker shared memory with HugeTLB pages. Reserve enough 2 MiB huge "
"pages before starting the worker."
msgstr "使用 HugeTLB 页面支持 worker 共享内存。启动 worker 前请预留足够的 2 MiB 大页。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`enable_fallocate=false`"
msgstr "`enable_fallocate=false`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Disables `fallocate` for the shared-memory file; use this setting with the "
"HugeTLB configuration above."
msgstr "禁用共享内存文件的 `fallocate`；请结合上述 HugeTLB 配置使用此设置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`rpc_thread_num=64`"
msgstr "`rpc_thread_num=64`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "Sets the RPC/ZMQ service concurrency."
msgstr "设置 RPC/ZMQ 服务的并发数。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`oc_thread_num=64`"
msgstr "`oc_thread_num=64`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "Sets the Object Cache business-thread pool size."
msgstr "设置对象缓存业务线程池大小。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`enable_worker_worker_batch_get=true`"
msgstr "`enable_worker_worker_batch_get=true`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "Enables batched Object Cache reads between Datasystem workers."
msgstr "启用数据系统工作节点之间的对象缓存批量读取。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`sc_regular_socket_num=0`, `sc_stream_socket_num=0`"
msgstr "`sc_regular_socket_num=0`, `sc_stream_socket_num=0`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Disables the Stream Cache service. Both values must be greater than zero to "
"enable it; keep them at zero when KV Pool does not use Stream Cache."
msgstr "禁用流缓存服务。两个值都必须大于零才能启用；当 KV 池不使用流缓存时，请保持为零。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:908
msgid ""
"For `shared_memory_size_mb=40960`, reserve at least 20480 2 MiB huge pages "
"and verify that they are available before starting the worker:"
msgstr ""
"对于 `shared_memory_size_mb=40960`，请预留至少 20480 个 2 MiB 巨页，并在启动工作节点前确认其可用："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:915
msgid ""
"Worker logs, including files whose base name is normally "
"`datasystem_worker`, are written under the `--log_dir` directory. Use an "
"absolute path so the log location does not depend on the worker process's "
"current directory."
msgstr ""
"工作节点日志（包括基本名称通常为 `datasystem_worker` 的文件）写入 `--log_dir` "
"目录下。请使用绝对路径，以确保日志位置不依赖于工作进程的当前目录。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:920
msgid ""
"These thread counts are tuning starting points rather than universal "
"defaults. Adjust them according to the available CPU cores and measured "
"request throughput. Because `-w` consumes the remaining command-line "
"arguments, place any `dscli start` options such as `--timeout` before `-w`."
msgstr ""
"这些线程计数是调优起点，而非通用默认值。请根据可用的 CPU 核心数和实测的请求吞吐量进行调整。由于 `-w` 会消耗剩余的命令行参数，请将 "
"`--timeout` 等 `dscli start` 选项放在 `-w` 之前。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:925
msgid ""
"For more parameters, refer to the `dscli` usage documentation on the "
"Yuanrong Datasystem official site: <https://atomgit.com/openeuler/yuanrong-"
"datasystem>"
msgstr ""
"更多参数，请参考元戎数据系统官方网站上的 `dscli` 使用文档：<https://atomgit.com/openeuler/yuanrong-"
"datasystem>"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:929
msgid "To stop the worker:"
msgstr "停止工作节点："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:937
msgid ""
"Set the following environment variables on each node before starting vLLM:"
msgstr "在启动 vLLM 之前，在每个节点上设置以下环境变量："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "Required"
msgstr "必需"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`PYTHONHASHSEED`"
msgstr "`PYTHONHASHSEED`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Must be consistent across all nodes to guarantee uniform hash generation."
msgstr "必须在所有节点上保持一致，以确保哈希生成统一。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`DS_WORKER_ADDR`"
msgstr "`DS_WORKER_ADDR`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "N/A"
msgstr "不适用"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Datasystem worker address in `<host>:<port>` format. This must match the "
"local `dscli start --worker_address` value."
msgstr ""
"数据系统工作节点地址，格式为 `<主机>:<端口>`。此值必须与本地的 `dscli start --worker_address` 值匹配。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`DATASYSTEM_CLIENT_LOG_DIR`"
msgstr "`DATASYSTEM_CLIENT_LOG_DIR`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`~/.datasystem/logs`"
msgstr "`~/.datasystem/logs`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Directory for Yuanrong client SDK logs created by the vLLM process. Use a "
"directory separate from the worker logs."
msgstr "vLLM 进程创建的元戎客户端 SDK 日志目录。请使用与工作节点日志不同的目录。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`DS_ENABLE_EXCLUSIVE_CONNECTION`"
msgstr "`DS_ENABLE_EXCLUSIVE_CONNECTION`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Passed to Yuanrong `HeteroClient.enable_exclusive_connection`. Use `1` to "
"enable the exclusive connection mode when required by your deployment."
msgstr ""
"传递给元戎 `HeteroClient.enable_exclusive_connection`。当部署需要时，使用 `1` 启用独占连接模式。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`DS_ENABLE_REMOTE_H2D`"
msgstr "`DS_ENABLE_REMOTE_H2D`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Passed to Yuanrong `HeteroClient.enable_remote_h2d`. Use `1` only after the "
"Remote H2D requirements below are met."
msgstr "传递给元戎 `HeteroClient.enable_remote_h2d`。仅在满足以下远程 H2D 要求后使用 `1`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:957
msgid ""
"Set `DATASYSTEM_CLIENT_LOG_DIR` before starting vLLM because the Yuanrong "
"client reads it during logging initialization. Client SDK logs, whose base "
"name is normally `ds_client`, are written to this directory."
msgstr ""
"在启动 vLLM 之前设置 `DATASYSTEM_CLIENT_LOG_DIR`，因为元戎客户端在日志初始化期间会读取该变量。客户端 SDK "
"日志（基本名称通常为 `ds_client`）将写入此目录。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:961
msgid "Remote H2D Requirements"
msgstr "远程 H2D 要求"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:963
msgid ""
"Set `DS_ENABLE_REMOTE_H2D=1` only when Remote Host-to-Device transfer is "
"enabled and verified in the Yuanrong Datasystem deployment:"
msgstr "仅在元戎数据系统部署中启用并验证了远程主机到设备传输时，才设置 `DS_ENABLE_REMOTE_H2D=1`："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:966
msgid ""
"Reserve enough 2 MiB HugeTLB pages before starting the worker. For 40 GiB "
"shared memory, reserve at least 20480 2 MiB huge pages."
msgstr "在启动工作节点前预留足够的 2 MiB HugeTLB 页。对于 40 GiB 共享内存，请预留至少 20480 个 2 MiB 巨页。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:968
msgid ""
"Start each Datasystem worker with Remote H2D enabled. The worker start "
"command must include `--remote_h2d_device_ids`, `--enable_huge_tlb true`, "
"`--arena_per_tenant 1`, and `--enable_fallocate false`. Using multiple "
"available NPU device IDs is recommended, for example `\"0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7\"` "
"on an 8-NPU node."
msgstr ""
"以启用远程 H2D 的方式启动每个数据系统工作节点。工作节点启动命令必须包含 "
"`--remote_h2d_device_ids`、`--enable_huge_tlb true`、`--arena_per_tenant 1` 和 "
"`--enable_fallocate false`。建议使用多个可用的 NPU 设备 ID，例如在 8-NPU 节点上使用 "
"`\"0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7\"`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:991
msgid ""
"Make sure the NPU driver, firmware, and CANN toolkit required by Yuanrong "
"Remote H2D are installed and visible to the worker process. In containers, "
"mount the Ascend driver path, `npu-smi`, `hccn_tool`, `/etc/hccn.conf`, "
"`/etc/ascend_install.info`, and the required `/dev/davinci*` devices."
msgstr ""
"确保元戎远程 H2D 所需的 NPU 驱动程序、固件和 CANN 工具包已安装且工作进程可见。在容器中，请挂载 Ascend 驱动路径、`npu-"
"smi`、`hccn_tool`、`/etc/hccn.conf`、`/etc/ascend_install.info` 以及所需的 "
"`/dev/davinci*` 设备。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:995
msgid "Verify the NPU and RoCE environment before enabling the client flag:"
msgstr "在启用客户端标志前，验证 NPU 和 RoCE 环境："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1023
msgid ""
"If these checks fail, keep `DS_ENABLE_REMOTE_H2D=0` and use the default "
"Datasystem transfer path."
msgstr "如果这些检查失败，请保持 `DS_ENABLE_REMOTE_H2D=0` 并使用默认的数据系统传输路径。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1026
msgid "Run AscendStoreConnector with Yuanrong backend"
msgstr "使用元戎后端运行 AscendStoreConnector"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1028
msgid "Use `AscendStoreConnector` with `backend: \"yuanrong\"`:"
msgstr "使用 `AscendStoreConnector` 并设置 `backend: \"yuanrong\"`："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1054
msgid ""
"`lookup_rpc_port` is the RPC port used between the pooling scheduler process"
" and the worker process. Each instance must use a unique port value."
msgstr "`lookup_rpc_port` 是池化调度器进程与工作节点进程之间使用的 RPC 端口。每个实例必须使用唯一的端口值。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1057
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1059
msgid ""
"The Yuanrong backend normalizes KV keys before calling Datasystem. Supported"
" ASCII keys up to 1024 bytes are preserved. Longer keys or keys containing "
"unsupported characters are rewritten to a maximum of 1024 characters with a "
"hash suffix, so do not rely on the raw key string when debugging backend "
"storage."
msgstr ""
"元戎后端在调用数据系统之前会规范化 KV 键。支持的最长 1024 字节的 ASCII 键会被保留。更长的键或包含不支持字符的键会被重写为最多 1024"
" 个字符并附加哈希后缀，因此在调试后端存储时，请不要依赖原始键字符串。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1064
msgid ""
"No extra buffer pre-registration step is required for Yuanrong. The backend "
"uses device pointers directly when building blob lists."
msgstr "元戎不需要额外的缓冲区预注册步骤。后端在构建 blob 列表时直接使用设备指针。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1069
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1071
msgid "1. Mooncake FAQ"
msgstr "1.Mooncake 常见问题"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1073
msgid "1.1 failed to put/get key"
msgstr "1.1 put/get 键失败"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1075
msgid ""
"When vLLM reports failed `put` or `get` operations, first check whether the "
"error is reported by Mooncake itself."
msgstr "当 vLLM 报告 `put` 或 `get` 操作失败时，首先检查错误是否由 Mooncake 自身报告。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1077
msgid "If the error is reported by Mooncake:"
msgstr "如果错误由 Mooncake 报告："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1078
msgid ""
"For `put` failures, check whether the Mooncake log contains "
"`NO_AVAILABLE_HANDLE` or `BatchPut failed ... due to insufficient space`. "
"This usually means the remaining space after eviction is not enough for one "
"`BatchPut` request. Ensure the space left by the eviction policy (for "
"example, the capacity implied by `1 - eviction_ratio`) can hold one batch "
"put, or consider increasing the available capacity, increasing eviction "
"headroom, or reducing the batch size."
msgstr ""
"对于 `put` 失败，请检查 Mooncake 日志是否包含 `NO_AVAILABLE_HANDLE` 或 `BatchPut failed ..."
" due to insufficient space`。这通常意味着驱逐后剩余的空间不足以容纳一个 `BatchPut` 请求。请确保驱逐策略（例如 "
"`1 - eviction_ratio` 隐含的容量）留下的空间可以容纳一次批量 put，或者考虑增加可用容量、增加驱逐余量或减小批量大小。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1079
msgid ""
"For `get` failures, check whether the Mooncake log contains "
"`lease_expired_before_data_transfer_completed key=...` or returns "
"`LEASE_EXPIRED`. This means the KV object lease expired before the data "
"transfer completed. Increase `--default_kv_lease_ttl` for `mooncake_master` "
"as needed, and keep it larger than `ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT` and "
"`ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT`."
msgstr ""
"对于`get`失败，请检查Mooncake日志是否包含`lease_expired_before_data_transfer_completed "
"key=...`或返回`LEASE_EXPIRED`。这意味着KV对象租约在数据传输完成前已过期。根据需要增加`mooncake_master`的`--default_kv_lease_ttl`，并使其大于`ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT`和`ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1080
msgid ""
"If the error is not reported by Mooncake, it is likely an HIXL "
"(ascend_direct) transfer-layer issue. Collect plog files under "
"`/root/ascend/log/debug/plog` and check whether the issue matches a known "
"HIXL problem."
msgstr ""
"如果错误不是由Mooncake报告的，则很可能是HIXL（ascend_direct）传输层问题。收集`/root/ascend/log/debug/plog`目录下的plog文件，并检查该问题是否与已知的HIXL问题匹配。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1082
#, python-format
msgid ""
"For common troubleshooting and issue localization guidance for HIXL "
"(ascend_direct), see: "
"<https://gitcode.com/cann/hixl/wiki/HIXL%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E5%AE%9A%E4%BD%8D%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C.md>"
msgstr ""
"有关HIXL（ascend_direct）的常见故障排除和问题定位指南，请参阅：<https://gitcode.com/cann/hixl/wiki/HIXL%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E5%AE%9A%E4%BD%8D%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C.md>"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1085
msgid "1.2 SSD FAQ"
msgstr "1.2 SSD常见问题"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1087
msgid "1.2.1 SEGMENT_NOT_FOUND with SSD offload"
msgstr "1.2.1 SSD卸载时的SEGMENT_NOT_FOUND"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1089
msgid ""
"If client logs show `OffloadObjectHeartbeat failed, error code is "
"SEGMENT_NOT_FOUND`, Master has unmounted the rank's `LOCAL_DISK` segment "
"(usually after `client_expired` when Ping stops refreshing TTL). SSD offload"
" on that rank stops until the segment is registered again."
msgstr ""
"如果客户端日志显示`OffloadObjectHeartbeat failed, error code is "
"SEGMENT_NOT_FOUND`，则Master已卸载该rank的`LOCAL_DISK`段（通常在Ping停止刷新TTL导致`client_expired`后）。该rank上的SSD卸载将停止，直到该段被重新注册。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1091
msgid ""
"**Typical trigger (with `enable_cpu_binding=true`):** Mooncake starts Ping "
"during init, then vLLM-Ascend `bind_cpus()` runs `migratepages`/IRQ binding;"
" the Ping thread is not pinned and can miss beats under the default "
"`client_ttl=10`."
msgstr ""
"**典型触发条件（当`enable_cpu_binding=true`时）：** Mooncake在初始化期间启动Ping，然后vLLM-"
"Ascend的`bind_cpus()`运行`migratepages`/IRQ绑定；Ping线程未被绑定，因此在默认`client_ttl=10`下可能错过心跳。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "Mitigation"
msgstr "缓解措施"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "**Temporary:** raise Master TTL"
msgstr "**临时措施：** 提高Master TTL"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"e.g. `mooncake_master ... --client_ttl=120`. Tune to your init/warmup window"
" (often `60`–`120` is enough). Does not fix the root cause."
msgstr ""
"例如 `mooncake_master ... "
"--client_ttl=120`。根据您的初始化/预热窗口进行调整（通常`60`–`120`就足够了）。不能解决根本原因。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "**Recovery:** upgrade Mooncake"
msgstr "**恢复措施：** 升级Mooncake"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Versions **> v0.3.11** (main branch) can remount `LOCAL_DISK` and rescan "
"metadata after `SEGMENT_NOT_FOUND`. This **recovers after** cleanup; it does"
" **not** prevent expiry or in-flight request failures while metadata is "
"gone."
msgstr ""
"版本**> "
"v0.3.11**（主分支）可以在`SEGMENT_NOT_FOUND`后重新挂载`LOCAL_DISK`并重新扫描元数据。这会在清理后**恢复**；它**不能**防止元数据丢失期间的过期或正在进行的请求失败。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "**Root fix:** Mooncake Ping CPU affinity"
msgstr "**根本修复：** Mooncake Ping CPU亲和性"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Pin the storage Ping thread to a release/isolated CPU (Mooncake-side "
"change). Optional vLLM-Ascend cooperation to pass the release CPU per rank."
msgstr ""
"将存储Ping线程绑定到一个释放/隔离的CPU上（Mooncake侧更改）。可选的vLLM-Ascend协作以传递每个rank的释放CPU。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1099
msgid ""
"Also restart Master together with vLLM to avoid stale "
"`segment_already_exists` state when debugging restarts."
msgstr "同时重启Master和vLLM，以避免在调试重启时出现陈旧的`segment_already_exists`状态。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1101
msgid ""
"1.2.2 Fabric memory size alignment (A3 + `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1`)"
msgstr "1.2.2 Fabric内存大小对齐（A3 + `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1`）"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1103
msgid ""
"On A3 with fabric memory enabled, **each** fabric mem allocation must be an "
"integer multiple of **1 GB** (1073741824 bytes). Mooncake does not round "
"sizes up automatically."
msgstr ""
"在启用了fabric内存的A3上，**每个**fabric内存分配必须是**1 "
"GB**（1073741824字节）的整数倍。Mooncake不会自动向上取整大小。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "Config source"
msgstr "配置来源"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "Alignment"
msgstr "对齐要求"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`global_segment_size`"
msgstr "`global_segment_size`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "`mooncake.json` or export `MOONCAKE_GLOBAL_SEGMENT_SIZE`"
msgstr "`mooncake.json` 或导出 `MOONCAKE_GLOBAL_SEGMENT_SIZE`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid "Each rank's segment size must be aligned to 1GB (e.g. `\"1GB\"`, `\"20GB\"`)."
msgstr "每个rank的段大小必须对齐到1GB（例如 `\"1GB\"`、`\"20GB\"`）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"export `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` (only when "
"`enable_ssd_offload=true`)"
msgstr ""
"导出 `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`（仅当 `enable_ssd_offload=true` "
"时）"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md
msgid ""
"Must be aligned to 1GB. Default is 1280 MB (1.25 GB), which is **not** "
"aligned and is too small for long-context SSD loads — size with [Sizing "
"MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES](#123-sizing-"
"mooncake_offload_local_buffer_size_bytes)."
msgstr ""
"必须对齐到1GB。默认值为1280 MB（1.25 "
"GB），这**未**对齐，并且对于长上下文SSD负载来说太小——请参考[调整MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES大小](#123-sizing-"
"mooncake_offload_local_buffer_size_bytes)进行设置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1110
msgid ""
"`local_buffer_size` in `mooncake.json` is **not** used under fabric mem "
"(vLLM-Ascend passes `0` to `setup()`)."
msgstr ""
"`mooncake.json`中的`local_buffer_size`在fabric内存下**不**被使用（vLLM-"
"Ascend向`setup()`传递`0`）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1112
msgid ""
"**Risk if misaligned:** `adxl MallocMem` / `aclrtMapMem` fails with "
"`Invalid_Argument`. With SSD offload enabled, a failed "
"`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` allocation can segfault during "
"`FileStorage` init and abort vLLM startup. Avoid values such as "
"`\"1280MB\"`, `\"512MB\"`, or `\"1.5GB\"`."
msgstr ""
"**未对齐的风险：** `adxl MallocMem` / `aclrtMapMem` 失败并返回 "
"`Invalid_Argument`。启用SSD卸载后，`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`分配失败可能导致`FileStorage`初始化期间出现段错误并中止vLLM启动。避免使用诸如"
" `\"1280MB\"`、`\"512MB\"` 或 `\"1.5GB\"` 之类的值。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1114
msgid ""
"**Fabric mem quota:** Both `global_segment_size` and "
"`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` are separate fabric mem "
"allocations **per rank**. Their sizes add up against the HIXL fabric mem "
"limit configured via `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` (e.g. "
"`\"fabric_memory.max_capacity\":32`, unit GB per process — see HIXL docs). "
"Rough budget per rank:"
msgstr ""
"**Fabric内存配额：** `global_segment_size` 和 "
"`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` "
"都是**每个rank**独立的fabric内存分配。它们的大小累加后受限于通过 `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` "
"配置的HIXL fabric内存限制（例如 "
"`\"fabric_memory.max_capacity\":32`，单位GB/进程——请参阅HIXL文档）。每个rank的大致预算："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1120
msgid ""
"**Risk if quota is too low:** Some ranks fail with "
"`Memory_Allocation_Failure(EL0004)` after `global_segment_size` succeeds but"
" `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` allocation fails. Increase "
"`fabric_memory.max_capacity`, reduce `global_segment_size` or "
"`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`, or ensure the node has enough "
"host memory."
msgstr ""
"**配额过低的风险：** "
"某些rank在`global_segment_size`成功但`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`分配失败时，会失败并返回`Memory_Allocation_Failure(EL0004)`。请增加`fabric_memory.max_capacity`，减少`global_segment_size`或`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`，或确保节点有足够的主机内存。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1122
msgid "Example (add to your vLLM startup script when SSD offload is on):"
msgstr "示例（在启用SSD卸载时添加到您的vLLM启动脚本中）："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1129
msgid "**set ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG only if fabric mem is too low.**"
msgstr "**仅在fabric内存过低时设置ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG。**"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1136
msgid "1.2.3 Sizing MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES"
msgstr "1.2.3 调整MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES大小"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1138
msgid ""
"When `enable_ssd_offload=true`, Mooncake allocates a **separate per-rank SSD"
" read/write buffer** sized by `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`. "
"This buffer is **independent** of `global_segment_size` in `mooncake.json` —"
" increasing the segment does **not** fix `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` caused by an "
"undersized `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`."
msgstr ""
"当`enable_ssd_offload=true`时，Mooncake会分配一个**独立的、每个rank的SSD读写缓冲区**，其大小由`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`决定。此缓冲区**独立于**`mooncake.json`中的`global_segment_size`——增加段大小并**不能**修复因`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`过小导致的`BUFFER_OVERFLOW`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1140
msgid ""
"If the buffer is too small, SSD reads fail with `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` "
"(`error_code=-10`) during `FileStorage::AllocateBatch`, and vLLM may fail "
"when `kv_load_failure_policy=fail`."
msgstr ""
"如果缓冲区太小，SSD读取会在`FileStorage::AllocateBatch`期间失败并返回`BUFFER_OVERFLOW`（`error_code=-10`），并且当`kv_load_failure_policy=fail`时，vLLM可能会失败。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1142
msgid ""
"If you encounter `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` during use, try increasing "
"`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`. Do not set it higher than the "
"**Available KV cache memory** value shown in vLLM worker logs:"
msgstr ""
"如果在使用过程中遇到`BUFFER_OVERFLOW`，请尝试增加`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`。不要将其设置得高于vLLM工作进程日志中显示的**可用KV缓存内存**值："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1148
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1154
msgid ""
"Use **byte literals only** (`10737418240`). `10G` / `10GB` are ignored and "
"fall back to the 1280 MB default."
msgstr "**仅使用字节字面量**（`10737418240`）。`10G` / `10GB` 将被忽略并回退到1280 MB的默认值。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1159
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` only chunks prefill compute; it does **not** "
"reduce the memory required by `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` "
"仅对预填充计算进行分块；它并**不能**减少`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`所需的内存。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1163
msgid "Host memory budget (single node)"
msgstr "主机内存预算（单节点）"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1165
msgid ""
"`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` is allocated **per rank**, in "
"addition to `global_segment_size`:"
msgstr ""
"`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` 是**按每个 rank** 分配的，额外于 "
"`global_segment_size`："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1171
msgid ""
"Ensure `free -h` **available** on the host exceeds this sum plus vLLM "
"overhead. `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` does **not** need to "
"fit inside `global_segment_size`."
msgstr ""
"确保主机上 `free -h` 的 **可用** 内存超过此总和加上 vLLM "
"开销。`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` **不** 需要适配在 "
"`global_segment_size` 内。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1173
msgid "Verify after tuning"
msgstr "调优后验证"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1175
msgid ""
"Startup: each rank logs `AlignedClientBufferAllocator: allocated <N> bytes` "
"with your configured size."
msgstr ""
"启动时：每个 rank 会记录 `AlignedClientBufferAllocator: allocated <N> "
"bytes`，其中包含您配置的大小。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1176
msgid ""
"Under load: no `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` / `Failed to get ... keys out of ... "
"error_codes=[-10]`."
msgstr ""
"负载下：无 `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` / `Failed to get ... keys out of ... "
"error_codes=[-10]`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1177
msgid ""
"If failures persist with a large buffer, check overlapping loads "
"(`load_async`)."
msgstr "如果使用大缓冲区时故障仍然存在，请检查重叠加载（`load_async`）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1179
msgid "2. Memcache FAQ"
msgstr "2.Memcache 常见问题"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1181
msgid ""
"For Memcache troubleshooting, see: "
"<https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/FAQ.md>"
msgstr ""
"有关 Memcache 故障排除，请参见：<https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/FAQ.md>"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1184
msgid "3. DSv4 known issue (temporary)"
msgstr "3.DSv4 已知问题（临时）"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:1186
msgid ""
"For the temporary DSv4 known issue, see: <https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/9975>"
msgstr ""
"有关临时 DSv4 已知问题，请参见：<https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/9975>"
